usiness_id":"nVLY5-SfBToQv1Z2uj7cLQ","review_id":"--4E_HKuI5JZeJCm1bnX7w","date":"2020-12-07T00:19:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9413714408874512,"text_excerpt":"Definitely hit the spot! Usually after dinner I'm always wanting cookies. Try finding cookies after dinner. That use to be a challenge until I found this place! I was able to satisfy my after dinner cookie craving. They even warned it up for me! Paired with ice cream. Now they sell cookie dough mainly, but I didn't get any of that. It looked good. And there were a lot of flavors. Maybe I'll try that next time"},{"business_id":"nVLY5-SfBToQv1Z2uj7cLQ","review_id":"5Sg0woq7paelimrv0EmXvw","date":"2021-05-01T03:44:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9278677105903625,"text_excerpt":"You can taste as many as you'd like! I had a great experience at this establishment. I had a craving for ice cream and I wanted a cookie as well. Naturally I opened my Yelp all and did a search to see what new place I could try. I had my daughter (5 months) with me and she had fallen asleep, so I needed to find a place that wasn't crowded and I could get in and out of. Cookie Dough Bliss was on my route home so I stopped by. I was greeted with a warm welcome upon my arrival and asked if it was my first time in the shop, I responded with a yes and that I had found the business on Yelp! The owner, gave me an overview of what they offer and let me know I could sample as many flavors of cooki..."},{"business_id":"nVLY5-SfBToQv1Z2uj7cLQ","review_id":"J4p5a2THcwLTpjIcsXABmw","date":"2020-02-26T05:23:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9261873960494995,"text_excerpt":"If you like cookie dough this is the place for you. I'm not a fan of cookie dough, honestly can't understand the hype. But this place is legit. I was craving ice cream but if I'm leaving my house I want to try new places. We found this place on yelp. We walked in and the place was spotless. Smelled clean without the overwhelming smell of disinfectant you get in other places. The owner greeted us (cant remember his name but he was really nice) and explained how the menu works. They offer a wide variety of homemade flavors, you can get a cup, Homemade cone, get it as a cookie sandwich, or as milkshakes. We sample 6 flavor, all good in their own way. My husband got a double chocolate with ch..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"nVLY5-SfBToQv1Z2uj7cLQ","photo_id":"jXwyqcIG493rMs3hB7kHtA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jXwyqcIG493rMs3hB7kHtA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9250636696815491},{"business_id":"nVLY5-SfBToQv1Z2uj7cLQ","photo_id":"hpDK2ri9WzHSONIXkF_ijQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hpDK2ri9WzHSONIXkF_ijQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9213006496429443},{"business_id":"nVLY5-SfBToQv1Z2uj7cLQ","photo_id":"2JUV92AiPq27XBl-RK6mYg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2JUV92AiPq27XBl-RK6mYg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8973231315612793},{"business_id":"nVLY5-SfBToQv1Z2uj7cLQ","photo_id":"Zhs5UmoDI2gFg6s2fUINwQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Zhs5UmoDI2gFg6s2fUINwQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8590150475502014}]},"notebook_case":null}
